# The DAgger run: the rebalanced set plus the expert's corrections from the published
# policy's own missed grasps (datasets/chess_dagger_captures), the corrections weighted
# three times in the merge. Continued from the published policy at a tenth of the
# learning rate, the schedule the last two continuations survived undamaged
# (docs/EXPERIMENTS.md 4.7-4.9). The question is whether corrections recorded from the
# states the policy actually reaches do what noise-recorded demonstrations did not.
source training/settings.rebalance_lowlr.env
DATASET_ROOT=datasets/lerobot/chess_mc_dagger
OUTPUT_DIR=outputs/molmoact2_mc_v5
